{
    "title": "Scary Horror 2: Escape Games",
    "description": "Scary games offline free and escape room quests are waiting for you! Solve mystery of the horror house and feel true fear.\r\n***\r\n<strong>CHAPTER 3 IS FINALLY OUT!</strong>\r\n***\r\nNew creepy escape room horror \u2013 Scary Horror Escape, part 2! Become a character in really scary games: incredible horror adventure full of terror and suspense, elaborate puzzles and riddles, unexpected plot twists, thrilling mysteries and jumpscares. Be prepared to face your fear in survival horror games offline!\r\n\r\n<strong>CHAPTER 1: Kidnapping </strong>\r\n\r\nSomeone puts a bag on your head and drags you to the car. Where are they taking you? What\u2019s happening\u2026 You open your eyes in some god-forsaken place. Dirty room, dim lights, no way out! What a wicked game is it? You have to find out! \r\n\r\nGo on a scary adventure, solve puzzles to unfold secrets and find the way out of the nightmare in horror escape games with many levels.\r\n\r\n<strong>CHAPTER 2: Scary Mansion</strong>\r\n\r\nHaunted house, cursed artifacts, secret doors. Don\u2019t close your eyes cause terrible nightmares and ghosts can be waiting everywhere. Find hidden objects, survive and solve mystery in this horror tale! Now you\u2019re a puppet in someone\u2019s hands. Can you escape?\r\n\r\nWell-made brain teaser for those who like creepy games, scary puzzle games and house escape genre. This mind-blowing thriller will take you through an unforgettable horror story infused with spooky mysteries and evil traps. Live-like animation with eerie sound effects creates an atmosphere of a real terror. Difficult puzzles and elaborate riddles make your brain work at its full capacity in these mystery games.\r\n\r\nUNFORGETTABLE HORROR ADVENTURE\r\n\r\n* Escape room horror with multiple locations\r\n* Many challenging puzzles and interesting riddles\r\n* Creepy adventure story that gives you goosebumps\r\n* Intriguing plot twists and the ending you never see coming\r\n* High-quality graphics and realistic picture \r\n* Eerie atmosphere and spooky sound effects\r\n* Scary horror games offline free \r\n* Hints and clear clues\r\n* Simple controls and user-friendly interface\r\n\r\nChallenge yourself with high-quality escape horror games! Try get out alive, unfold the secret and don\u2019t let your fear take control of you. Is it possible to run away from a room with no doors and windows? We\u2019ll see. These very scary games for adults & room escape adventure are for those who are ready to solve mysteries and meet the true fear. \r\n\r\nPut your best efforts into finding answers and solving riddles to win these scary escape games for free. Start your horror adventure: explore creepy rooms full of ghosts, open locked doors, gather clues to get out of the dead end and uncover the evil truth of your abduction. Those who kidnapped you should pay for that, right?\r\n\r\nHorror puzzle games combine scary survival with escape room horror, it\u2019ll give you goosebumps, for sure. Not only will you solve riddles to escape from the maniac mansion but you\u2019ll also become a part of the plot and see how the terror story ends. \r\n\r\nFor those who like creepy escape adventure and high-quality horror games, we have mystery escape games with many levels for kids and adults and other survival horror games offline for free. Check out \u201cEscape Adventure Games\u201d page, play all spooky escape room quests and puzzles, wait for more super scary games.",
